      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<section class=\"sr-journal sr-handout\"><p class=\"sr-eyebrow\">STILLROOT'S SONG &nbsp; | &nbsp; PLAYER HANDOUT</p><h1>What we can prove</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Evidence</th>\n<th>Where we found it</th>\n<th>Who can corroborate it</th>\n<th>What it might mean</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Something that changed:</strong> ______________________</p>\n<p><strong>Something physical that did not change:</strong> ______________________</p>\n<p><strong>A countermeasure we tested:</strong> ______________________</p>\n<p><strong>A person we have promised to help:</strong> ______________________</p>\n<p>A suspicion is not the same thing as proof. Keep both, and label which is which.</p>\n</section>"
